WEBVTT

00:04:09.028 --> 00:04:11.468
ANNOUNCER: And now,
an exclusive sneak peek

00:04:11.548 --> 00:04:14.148
of Frozen 2. Click here.

00:04:18.268 --> 00:04:20.508
('80s POP MUSIC PLAYING)

00:04:27.348 --> 00:04:29.428
(SINGING)
Never gonna give you up

00:04:29.588 --> 00:04:31.548
Never gonna let you down

00:04:31.748 --> 00:04:35.708
Never gonna run around
and desert you

00:04:35.948 --> 00:04:37.828
Never gonna make you cry

00:04:38.108 --> 00:04:40.148
Never gonna say goodbye

00:04:40.228 --> 00:04:44.228
Never gonna tell a lie
and hurt you

00:04:44.308 --> 00:04:45.308
RALPH: Uh-uh!

00:04:45.388 --> 00:04:47.988
Why would I? I like you.

00:04:48.148 --> 00:04:49.868
You guys
still sticking around?

00:04:50.028 --> 00:04:52.428
All right. Well,
you're welcome to stay.

00:04:52.628 --> 00:04:56.148
There's not really any more
surprises, but, you know...

00:04:56.308 --> 00:04:58.268
Good luck getting that song
out of your head.

00:04:58.348 --> 00:04:59.628
It's a real earwig.

00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:02.508
(CHUCKLES)
Anyway, what else? Uh...

